    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακμ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be past the prime</i>, of fruits, etc., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.4.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρηκμακότες</span>, of old
			trees, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.4.7
			</span></i> ; of men compared to wine, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				45.5
