					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1389b13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1275a17
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῖς σώμασι</span>”
