				Plb.
				6.51.5
			</span></i> ; of sea-waves, <i>abate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				35
			</span></i> ; of passion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν δὲ μικρὸν παρακμάσῃ [ὀργή]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					573
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.</div>
